  "method": [
    "Clear the CSPICE kernel pool and furnish the listed files in order through 110317AP_RE_90165_18018.bsp.",
    "For each UTC, str2et; spkpos(653,et,J2000,LT+S,-82) gives apparent target vector and light time.",
    "pxform(J2000,IAU_AEGAEON,et-lightTime) gives the historical body rotation. reclat(bodyRotation * -apparentTargetVector) gives the reverse apparent viewing direction, not a surface intercept.",
